<title>USA: US Sen. D'Amato hopes rate rise controls inflation.</title>
<headline>US Sen. D'Amato hopes rate rise controls inflation.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Senate Banking Committee Chairman Alfonse D'Amato said Tuesday he hoped the Federal Reserve interest rate increase would keep inflation under control.</p>
<p>&quot;I'm hopeful that the chairman's (Fed Chairman Alan Greenspan) move will continue to keep inflation under control as well as permit economic growth,&quot; D'Amato, a New York Republican, said in a statement.</p>
</text>
